  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A second dog washing station in Cavalaire-sur-Mer — distinct from the iClean dogwash at the harbour already listed on the site — is located at the entrance of town, right next to the Avia Xpress petrol station (near Avenue de Saint-Raphaël, D559). It's a blue cabin from the Wash.ME Group brand, with a washing tub, hose and built-in dog dryer, immediately visible next to the petrol station.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>This listing was fully verified on site by the user, photos taken. The instructions displayed on the cabin follow 4 steps: put your dog in the tub by lowering the access ramp and attaching the supplied safety chain, touch the screen to choose the wash time and make the payment, use the hose and select programmes as needed (hypoallergenic shampoo, conditioner, anti-parasite treatment, rinse), then select "Drying" (pressing a second time stops the programme — towel-drying beforehand is recommended). Two options are offered on the home screen: "Small dog" at €10 for 10 minutes, or "Large dog" at €15 for 15 minutes; a "Custom time" option is also available, charged at about €1 per minute.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: look for the Avia petrol station at the entrance of Cavalaire — the washing station is right next to it, on the same side of the road, recognisable by its blue "Dog Wash Station" cabin.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The town centre and harbour of Cavalaire-sur-Mer, where the other dogwash listed on the site is located (iClean, open 24/7), are a few minutes' drive away.</p>
    </div>

